&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we are on a mission to help build a better Internet. Today the company runs one of the world’s largest networks that powers millions of websites and other Internet properties for customers ranging from individual bloggers to SMBs to Fortune 500 companies. Cloudflare protects and accelerates any Internet application online without adding hardware, installing software, or changing a line of code. Internet properties powered by Cloudflare all have web traffic routed through its intelligent global network, which gets smarter with every request. As a result, they see significant improvement in performance and a decrease in spam and other attacks. Cloudflare was named to Entrepreneur Magazine’s Top Company Cultures list and ranked among the World’s Most Innovative Companies by Fast Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we’re not looking for people who wait for a polished roadmap; we’re looking for the builders who see the cracks in the Internet that everyone else has simply learned to live with. We value candidates who have the instinct to spot a &quot;normalized&quot; problem and the AI-native curiosity to create a solution using the latest tools. Our culture is built on iteration, leveraging AI to ship faster today to make it better tomorrow, while ensuring that every improvement, no matter how small, is shared across the team to lift everyone up. If you’re the type of person who values curiosity over bureaucracy, and that AI is a partner in solving tough problems to keep the Internet moving forward, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(230, 126, 35);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Available Locations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Munich, Berlin or Frankfurt&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(230, 126, 35);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare is looking for a Startup Account Executive to join our Digital Natives team in Germany and Austria. You&#39;ll build your own customer base from the ground up, mostly through your own prospecting or by working closely with your BDR. Your job is to find promising startups across the region, win them early and help them build on Cloudflare as they grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work with AI startups, developer tool companies and other young tech businesses, often in the first years after their funding. Their teams are small, and founders make most of the decisions. Often an engineer has been using Cloudflare long before anyone talks to sales. You know this world, and you&#39;re comfortable talking about technology with a founder or CTO. You don&#39;t need to know every spec, but you understand what they&#39;re building and what Cloudflare can change for them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The pace is high. You&#39;ll spend a good part of your week reaching out to founders and engineers, following up and booking first meetings. You&#39;ll also build your network in the startup scene. VC firms, accelerators and founder communities are often the fastest way to the right companies, and you&#39;ll become a familiar face there. If you enjoy the hunt and like seeing your own work turn into new customers, you&#39;ll like this job.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for true team players. We win together, not as lone wolves with sharp elbows. You share what works, ask for help when you need it, and celebrate your colleagues&#39; wins as much as your own. You see your BDR, Solutions Engineers and specialists as real partners, not as support functions, and you bring the same care to working with your colleagues as you do to working with your customers. If you believe the best results come from people who make each other better, you&#39;ll feel right at home on our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI tools are a big part of how we sell. Many of the startups you work with are building AI products themselves, and they notice when you work the same way. We expect you to use AI every way, from researching accounts to preparing for meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(230, 126, 35);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building your customer base: Find and win new startup customers across DACH, and build your book of business from the first deal. Hit or beat your quarterly targets for new customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline generation: Own your pipeline from the first contact. Most of it will come from your own prospecting, such as cold outreach to founders and CTOs, LinkedIn and startup events. Your BDR supports you, but you set the pace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VC and accelerator relationships: Build relationships with VC firms, accelerators and startup programmes in DACH. Get to know their portfolios, find the companies where Cloudflare fits and get warm introductions to founders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product-led growth: Find startups whose developers already use Cloudflare&#39;s free or self-serve plans, and turn that usage into a commercial relationship as the company grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Founders and technical buyers: Have credible conversations with founders, CTOs and lead engineers about what they&#39;re building. Explain what Cloudflare changes for them, for example lower infrastructure costs or less time spent running infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI startups: Position Workers AI, AI Gateway, Vectorize and R2 with startups building AI products. Understand their usual problems, such as inference costs and securing AI APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast sales cycles: Run short, efficient sales cycles with many deals at the same time. Follow up quickly, spend your time on the startups with the most potential and close with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Long-term thinking: Choose startups that can grow into large customers, and set them up on Cloudflare in a way that lets them scale with us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamwork: Work closely with your BDR and Customer Engineers. Plan accounts together, bring them into conversations at the right moment and keep everyone up to date. Work with Sales Ops, Product and Customer Success to keep deals moving and get new customers off to a strong start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline and forecasting: Keep your pipeline in Salesforce accurate and give your manager forecasts they can rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI in your daily work: Use AI tools every day for account research, personalised outreach, meeting prep and follow-ups. In the interview, we&#39;ll ask you how AI helps you get better results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market insight: Share what you see in the DACH startup scene with the wider team, such as which funding rounds to watch and which technologies startups choose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(230, 126, 35);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Skills, Knowledge, and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sales Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in B2B technology sales with a quota, including at least one role you held for two years or more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Met or beat your quota in your most recent full year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Won new customers mainly through your own prospecting, such as cold email, calls and LinkedIn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy prospecting and are used to a high volume of outreach every week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sold to startups or scale-ups, or worked closely with VC firms or accelerators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run full sales cycles with many deals at the same time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally sold to developers or CTOs before&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked with a structured sales method such as MEDDPICC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Startup background&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally you&#39;ve worked at an AI or tech startup yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how startups are funded (seed, Series A, Series B) and what each stage means for their budget and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a network in the DACH startup scene, or you know how to build one quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical knowledge&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can explain the basics of how the internet works: DNS, CDN, TLS, HTTP and APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how startups typically build their products, using public cloud, serverless, open-source tools and AI APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid public cloud know-how. You understand how companies use AWS, GCP, Azure, including Kubernetes and serverless. What drives their cost and where Cloudflare complements or replaces them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how modern engineering teams ship software, including CI/CD and developer tooling such as GitHub, GitLab and AI coding tools like Claude Code.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowing Cloudflare (Workers, R2, AI Gateway, Zero Trust) or a competitor such as AWS, Akamai, Fastly or Vercel is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tools and ways of working&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use Salesforce or a similar CRM every day and keep your pipeline accurate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You already use AI tools in your sales work, for example ChatGPT, Claude or Gemini for research and writing, or Clay for account research. Be ready to show us how.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve worked in a team with BDRs and pre-sales engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German and English, spoken and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to travel within DACH and to startup events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(230, 126, 35);&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For Germany based hires: Estimated annual salary is between €152,000 - €209,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is eligible to earn incentive compensation under Cloudflare&#39;s Sales Compensation Plan. The estimated annual salary range includes the on-target incentive compensation that may be attained in this role under the Sales Compensation Plan. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equity:&amp;nbsp;This role is eligible to participate in Cloudflare&#39;s equity plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What Makes Cloudflare Special?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re not just a highly ambitious, large-scale technology company. We’re a highly ambitious, large-scale technology company with a soul. Fundamental to our mission to help build a better Internet is protecting the free and open Internet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
